flowchart TB
  Owner[Owner / Human Authority]
  Control[TOS Control Plane / Userland]
  Kernel[TOS Kernel / Privileged Admission]
  TSAL[TSAL Rules / Contracts / Proof Semantics]
  Modules[TOS Modules]
  Adapters[Provider / Project Adapters]
  Workloads[Managed Workloads: XQueue / Teach / Future]
  Providers[External Providers / Infrastructure]
  Evidence[Protected Evidence / Audit]

  Owner -->|goals / authority / limits| Control
  Control -->|escalate unresolved authority / uncertainty| Owner

  Control -.->|consult standards / schemas| TSAL
  Control -->|coordinate| Modules
  Modules -->|proposals / results| Control

  Control -->|privileged action proposal| Kernel
  Kernel -->|admit / deny / fence / bind| Adapters
  Kernel -->|authorized bounded action| Workloads
  Kernel -->|required audit / evidence| Evidence

  Control -->|read-only observation when policy permits| Adapters
  Control -->|facts / health / evidence| Workloads

  Adapters -->|authorized mutation or read| Providers
  Providers -->|observed state| Adapters
  Workloads -->|facts / evidence / outcomes| Control

  TSAL -.->|provider-neutral policy semantics| Kernel
